<section class="section-wrap how-section" id="how-it-works">
 <div class="section-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3 me-1" style="color:var(--p-pink)"></i> SYSTEMATIC APPROACH</p>
  <h2>Three steps to solve repeating problems.</h2>
  <p>From recognizing a recurring frustration to diagnosing the pattern and tracking the fix.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="step-grid">
  <article class="step-card card-rose">
   <div class="step-card-top">
    <span class="step-number">01</span>
    <span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-pencil-square" style="color:var(--p-rose-ink)"></i></span>
   </div>
   <h3>Log the problem</h3>
   <p>Document the problem with title, impact level, and category. Keep an organized log across all areas of your life.</p>
   <span class="step-doodle"><i class="bi bi-card-checklist"></i></span>
  </article>

  <article class="step-card card-butter">
   <div class="step-card-top">
    <span class="step-number">02</span>
    <span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat" style="color:var(--p-butter-ink)"></i></span>
   </div>
   <h3>Track occurrences</h3>
   <p>Whenever the issue repeats, add an occurrence date and notes. Pulse automatically alerts you when an issue repeats &gt; 3 times.</p>
   <span class="step-doodle"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle"></i></span>
  </article>

  <article class="step-card card-sky">
   <div class="step-card-top">
    <span class="step-number">03</span>
    <span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle" style="color:var(--p-sky-ink)"></i></span>
   </div>
   <h3>Test solutions &amp; resolve</h3>
   <p>Record solutions you've tested, measure whether the problem stops reoccurring, and mark it resolved with confidence.</p>
   <span class="step-doodle"><i class="bi bi-award"></i></span>
  </article>
 </div>
</section>
